      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-01T04:43:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know that there probably isn't a specific planning one way or another, and it's all due to story reasons and what not.....</p><p>But I wanted to say thanks for the fact that with the Freedom Six, you can get the majority of the unlocks in a single game (or 2) once you know the conditions. &nbsp;The last several all had such crazy random conditions involved that it was very hard to get multiple unlocks in a single game (unlike the original set of variants that could relatively easily all be obtained in a single game).</p><p>Like I said, I dunno if this actually enters his head or not or if story dictates all, but I prefer being able to get a couple in a game if I can.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:22.435Z",
