      "created_at": "2016-02-08T11:36:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had a fun unlock game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fighting Chairman at The Block. &nbsp;Had the loss to Iron Legacy set up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Argent Adept let Unity play a card, giving The Wraith a power use, doing 5 damage to Bunker, The Chairman, and The Operative, killing all 3 of them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unlocked The Wraith, Bunker, and Unity (she was at 6 hp with 7 bots out that turn). &nbsp;I was I think one Fleet of Foot shy of unlocking Tachyon as well (actually, can you get it with super scientific tachyon, or sdoes it have to be base?)<br><br>Just need Tempest and Tachyon now (got absolute zero earlier, using Unity to eat his equipment).</p>",
